Z||000000||Raydar||02-24-2000||10:40 PM||||Okay. REALLY showing my age, here.<BR>Anybody remember Rat Fink? Big Daddy Roth? All the outrageous cartoons and stuff? Check this link... <A HREF="http://www.mooneyesusa.com/13EDROTH.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.mooneyesusa.com/13EDROTH.htm</A> <BR>Or check the "mooneyes" home page... <A HREF="http://www.mooneyesusa.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.mooneyesusa.com/</A> <BR>Lots of insanity. Didn't know until yesterday that any Rat Fink stuff was still around. We're talking 35 years ago!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">||||reg||6
